[1.382, "o", "PROSE-ONLY is the majority and the important number: those cases carry\r\nan id and a sentence, no inputs and no expected values, so no runner\r\ncan ever execute them as written -- they are documentation shaped like\r\ntests. DEBT is executable in principle and blocked by numbered defects\r\n(#2410 slices, #2413 test emission). Neither counts as coverage.\r\n"]
